OL,3,GNEWSASenior doctors at Glasgow hospital
OL,4,Ain care delay warning
OL,5,
OL,6,FSenior emergency doctors at Scotland's
OL,7,Fbiggest hospital have written to the
OL,8,Fhealthcare watchdog to warn of harm to
OL,9,Fpatients from delays to care.
OL,11,FThe consultants also warned of
OL,12,F"uncontrollable system failure", in a
OL,13,Fletter sent to Healthcare Improvement
OL,14,FScotland (His) in July.
OL,16,FThey said the situation in the
OL,17,Femergency department at the Queen
OL,18,FElizabeth University Hospital (QEUH) in
OL,19,FGlasgow had deteriorated since their
OL,20,Flast review, which was undertaken in
OL,21,F2024 and published a year later.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,423,420,260,160,0,100
