OL,3,GNEWSASenior doctors at Glasgow hospital
OL,4,Ain care delay warning
OL,5,
OL,6,FThat report found that poor
OL,7,Frelationships between managers and
OL,8,Fconsultants was likely to have had a
OL,9,Fdetrimental impact on patient care.
